<title>USA: Kodak to boost Chinon stake to 50.1 percent.</title>
<headline>Kodak to boost Chinon stake to 50.1 percent.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastman Kodak Co said Thursday it will increase its stake in Japanese optical and scanner company Chinon to 50.1 percent from 12 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;Under the terms of the arrangement, Kodak would subscribe to a Chinon share issue of 9,910,000 shares at 190 yen per share, and Chinon would conclude a restructuring program it is announcing today,&quot; Kodak said in a statement.</p>
<p>Kodak said it and Chinon, which has posted losses since 1991/92, would collaborate on engineering and development of digital cameras and scanners.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
